WEBVTT

00:01:37.240 --> 00:01:38.320
Hey, are you finished?

00:01:38.320 --> 00:01:39.450
Almost.

00:01:39.450 --> 00:01:41.780
You made a flower ring, wow!

00:01:55.130 --> 00:01:57.760
It is called the Prophecy of Fatima.

00:01:57.760 --> 00:02:01.930
The Virgin Mary entrusted
three shepherds with three prophecies.

00:02:02.850 --> 00:02:08.140
The world war will end soon.
Two years later, it came to be.

00:02:08.140 --> 00:02:13.020
Another was that, in twenty years,
an even greater war will occur.

00:02:13.020 --> 00:02:19.110
And the final one has been sealed
away as a top secret by the Pope in Rome.

00:02:20.030 --> 00:02:25.910
But thanks to various inquiries,
the Order has come to a single conclusion.

00:02:25.910 --> 00:02:27.790
That is "The Servants."

00:02:28.460 --> 00:02:31.630
Namely, the appearance of God's Apostles.

00:02:31.630 --> 00:02:34.920
These people must be protected
by the Magdalene Order, no matter the cost.

00:02:40.550 --> 00:02:42.600
That girl is an Apostle?

00:02:43.260 --> 00:02:46.470
Right, she's from
the village of Fatima, in Portugal.

00:02:46.470 --> 00:02:49.270
At a mere twelve years old,
she's a soprano singer.

00:02:49.270 --> 00:02:51.270
Azmaria Hendric...

00:02:59.740 --> 00:03:04.200
She came over from Portugal
as a member of an orchestra,

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:07.830
but she was forcefully
pulled away, and now she sings like that.

00:03:07.830 --> 00:03:11.120
The orchestra she was
with has also gone missing.

00:03:11.120 --> 00:03:13.290
The Minister will look
into the orchestra, but...

00:03:15.290 --> 00:03:16.300
Lech.

00:03:16.300 --> 00:03:18.420
What?! No, I...

00:03:18.420 --> 00:03:21.340
More importantly, look, over there.

00:03:22.640 --> 00:03:24.970
The man sitting in the first row,

00:03:24.970 --> 00:03:26.810
Ricardo Hendric,

00:03:26.810 --> 00:03:29.180
the "king" of hotels,
the owner of this theater,

00:03:29.180 --> 00:03:32.140
and on top of that, a devil worshipper.

00:03:34.060 --> 00:03:35.360
That man...

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:36.690
What about Ricardo?

00:03:36.690 --> 00:03:38.940
No, the man beside him.

00:03:38.940 --> 00:03:40.650
What, do you know him?

00:03:40.650 --> 00:03:43.320
He's probably someone I know.

00:03:43.320 --> 00:03:44.490
A devil?

00:03:45.830 --> 00:03:50.200
So there's a contract with
a devil in the shadow of his success.

00:03:51.410 --> 00:03:54.540
The girl that is seen as an Apostle of God,

00:03:54.540 --> 00:03:57.000
and the devil summoner
that took custody of her...

00:03:58.050 --> 00:04:00.630
Isn't it kind of an interesting combination?

00:04:03.430 --> 00:04:05.510
How is it, Lerajie?

00:04:07.350 --> 00:04:08.720
It's no use.

00:04:08.720 --> 00:04:11.770
She hasn't even reached
half of what we can expect of her.

00:04:15.650 --> 00:04:18.360
That's enough. Go back to your room.

00:04:18.360 --> 00:04:19.940
What? But...

00:04:19.940 --> 00:04:21.400
Go back.

00:04:22.740 --> 00:04:24.950
Okay, I understand.

00:04:25.570 --> 00:04:27.870
Now, young miss, let's go to your room.

00:04:27.870 --> 00:04:28.870
Yes.

00:04:31.290 --> 00:04:33.710
It's been two months since we obtained her.

00:04:33.710 --> 00:04:35.790
Is she really the one?

00:04:35.790 --> 00:04:37.750
No need to worry.

00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:39.420
There are still inconsistencies,

00:04:39.420 --> 00:04:42.090
but definite results are beginning to appear.

00:04:42.090 --> 00:04:44.550
She will awaken soon.

00:04:51.140 --> 00:04:54.600
I am aware that time is short.

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:55.730
I'm counting on you.

00:04:55.730 --> 00:04:56.810
As you wish.

00:05:13.290 --> 00:05:15.120
Chrono, a coin.

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:16.460
What are you doing, all of a sudden?!

00:05:16.460 --> 00:05:17.920
It's not all of a sudden!

00:05:17.920 --> 00:05:20.380
This is no time to be
playing around in a casino!

00:05:21.130 --> 00:05:26.340
But, we <i>have</i> come
all this way, so just a little...

00:05:26.340 --> 00:05:29.640
And besides, I don't really get many
chances to wear something like this.

00:05:29.640 --> 00:05:32.470
Look, you were taken in
by this earlier too, right?

00:05:32.470 --> 00:05:37.980
Look, look, look...

00:05:38.850 --> 00:05:42.150
So come on, please give me a coin.

00:05:42.150 --> 00:05:43.480
No! The mission comes first!

00:05:43.480 --> 00:05:46.780
I don't want to! The slots are calling to me!

00:05:46.780 --> 00:05:49.320
At least let me play one more time.

00:05:54.620 --> 00:05:55.960
What's going on?

00:05:55.960 --> 00:05:58.670
This is horrible! Who did such a thing?

00:06:08.010 --> 00:06:10.840
Rosette, can you
hear me? Where are you now?

00:06:10.840 --> 00:06:13.680
Right now, I'm on Ricardo's private floor.

00:06:13.680 --> 00:06:15.020
How does it look?

00:06:15.020 --> 00:06:17.390
It looks like something happened.
Everyone is bustling about.

00:06:17.390 --> 00:06:18.520
What do you mean, something?

00:06:18.520 --> 00:06:22.650
I don't know, but keeping
them from spotting me is a pain.

00:06:22.650 --> 00:06:25.730
Well, that's fine, at least you're inside.

00:06:25.730 --> 00:06:29.860
It couldn't be helped. I'd be too
conspicuous if I brought a child.

00:06:29.860 --> 00:06:31.950
I'm counting on your
follow-through from up there.

00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:35.290
Counting on me? Well, you're a child too,

00:06:35.290 --> 00:06:37.790
<i>and</i> you broke the slot machine.

00:06:37.790 --> 00:06:38.620
Did you say something?

00:06:38.620 --> 00:06:40.830
No, nothing at all.

00:06:42.580 --> 00:06:44.460
Chrono? What's wrong?

00:06:46.550 --> 00:06:48.090
Not good!

00:06:51.720 --> 00:06:52.800
Somewhere...

00:07:03.520 --> 00:07:05.400
I'm sure I heard a woman's voice.

00:07:05.400 --> 00:07:07.990
Hey, have you found Lady Azmaria?

00:07:07.990 --> 00:07:09.650
No, not anywhere.

00:07:09.650 --> 00:07:12.410
In any case, quickly,
report this to Lord Lerajie.

00:07:12.410 --> 00:07:13.490
Understood.

00:07:18.950 --> 00:07:22.370
I'm sorry I surprised you.
I'm not anyone suspicious.

00:07:22.370 --> 00:07:24.250
Well, that's not very persuasive,

00:07:24.250 --> 00:07:25.880
not after I've come into a place like this.

00:07:25.880 --> 00:07:27.380
Well...

00:07:27.380 --> 00:07:31.430
Please don't tell anyone you met me, please.

00:07:31.430 --> 00:07:33.430
It's all right, you can relax.

00:07:33.430 --> 00:07:38.220
In fact, I'm extremely grateful to
have met you like this, Azmaria Hendric.

00:07:39.060 --> 00:07:41.020
Who are you?

00:07:42.440 --> 00:07:47.480
I'm Rosette Christopher,
from the Magdalene Order, here to rescue you.

00:07:47.480 --> 00:07:48.690
The Magdalene...

00:07:48.690 --> 00:07:52.240
Right, despite how I look, I'm actually a Sister.

00:07:52.860 --> 00:07:54.620
Now, let's hurry up and run away from here!

00:07:54.620 --> 00:07:55.490
But...

00:07:55.490 --> 00:07:57.700
It's all right. Leave it to me.

00:07:58.580 --> 00:08:04.920
Miss, this floor is supposed to
be off limits, so why are you here?

00:08:04.920 --> 00:08:07.420
Would you please answer me?

00:08:09.210 --> 00:08:10.260
Wait...

00:08:11.220 --> 00:08:14.800
This guest was just looking
for something, and I came with her.

00:08:14.800 --> 00:08:15.930
I see.

00:08:15.930 --> 00:08:19.140
Then let us leave this to
those in charge of the guest rooms.

00:08:19.140 --> 00:08:21.730
Young miss, please return to your room.

00:08:21.730 --> 00:08:22.730
Okay.

00:08:25.650 --> 00:08:28.520
If you please, this way.

00:08:28.520 --> 00:08:31.030
I'll show you to the front desk.

00:08:38.120 --> 00:08:39.330
Ow ow ow ow...

00:08:39.330 --> 00:08:41.620
Chrono!

00:08:49.130 --> 00:08:50.340
Chrono, come on!

00:08:50.340 --> 00:08:51.340
Right!

00:08:51.340 --> 00:08:53.010
We're going to jump. Hold on!

00:09:10.020 --> 00:09:13.240
I see, Chrono, so it's you.

00:09:19.450 --> 00:09:21.160
Rosette, they've come!

00:09:21.160 --> 00:09:22.540
Stubborn, aren't they?

00:09:29.880 --> 00:09:30.840
Run!

00:09:44.600 --> 00:09:47.940
Are you all right, Azmaria?
Are you hurt anywhere?

00:09:53.730 --> 00:09:55.570
Dear! Hold on!

00:09:57.150 --> 00:10:00.200
Somebody! Please call an ambulance! Hurry!

00:10:00.200 --> 00:10:01.740
Help me!

00:10:01.740 --> 00:10:02.870
Somebody!

00:10:03.950 --> 00:10:05.540
What have we...?

00:10:19.340 --> 00:10:22.970
Those things were just
stone statues infused with mystical power.

00:10:22.970 --> 00:10:27.020
That doesn't matter. This is our fault!

00:10:27.020 --> 00:10:28.140
I know that!

00:10:28.140 --> 00:10:29.350
You're wrong.

00:10:30.190 --> 00:10:34.480
It's my fault,all of it,mine.

00:10:34.480 --> 00:10:35.860
Azmaria?

00:10:35.860 --> 00:10:38.780
This kind of thing...
This kind of thing happened,

00:10:38.780 --> 00:10:40.410
all of it because of me.

00:10:41.660 --> 00:10:45.990
Father, Mother, everyone...

00:10:45.990 --> 00:10:47.370
Everyone!

00:10:55.960 --> 00:10:57.460
Azmaria?

00:11:28.950 --> 00:11:30.330
What? My injuries...

00:11:30.330 --> 00:11:31.370
They're healing?

00:11:31.370 --> 00:11:32.170
We're alive!

00:11:32.170 --> 00:11:33.000
Thank goodness!

00:11:37.920 --> 00:11:39.210
Chrono...

00:11:39.880 --> 00:11:43.890
If this power is proof
that she is an Apostle, then...

00:11:43.890 --> 00:11:45.800
Then that means...

00:11:45.800 --> 00:11:46.850
I know.

00:11:58.570 --> 00:12:00.110
Azmaria!

00:12:00.110 --> 00:12:02.070
Azmaria! Azmaria!

00:12:02.070 --> 00:12:06.240
Azmaria!

00:12:06.240 --> 00:12:08.330
This we can use.

00:12:08.330 --> 00:12:11.250
It can't be helped, the report comes first.

00:12:12.210 --> 00:12:15.250
The fun will come after that, Chrono.

00:12:23.010 --> 00:12:26.680
Please tell me, what are the Apostles?

00:12:26.680 --> 00:12:29.010
What is the matter, Rosette?

00:12:29.010 --> 00:12:30.310
I want to know.

00:12:30.310 --> 00:12:32.730
After seeing Azmaria,
there is something that I just have

00:12:32.730 --> 00:12:34.270
About Joshua, right?

00:12:35.770 --> 00:12:37.230
That's it, isn't it?

00:12:37.230 --> 00:12:37.940
Yes.

00:12:37.940 --> 00:12:38.940
Remington!

00:12:39.730 --> 00:12:44.490
No, Sister Kate.
Isn't it about time we told her?

00:12:47.740 --> 00:12:52.950
It's just as you think. Joshua is an Apostle.

00:13:01.340 --> 00:13:03.050
I thought so.

00:13:03.050 --> 00:13:05.260
The Apostles of God...

00:13:05.260 --> 00:13:08.180
In other words, those who have
been entrusted with power by God.

00:13:08.180 --> 00:13:10.390
That is why we wanted to
guard her, no matter what.

00:13:10.390 --> 00:13:12.220
Why is Joshua...?

00:13:12.220 --> 00:13:16.600
Only God knows
in whom the miracles reside.

00:13:16.600 --> 00:13:19.230
And because of that, Joshua is...

00:13:22.940 --> 00:13:25.570
There are likely seven Apostles,

00:13:25.570 --> 00:13:29.780
who possess the power of,
what we call, the seven virtues.

00:13:29.780 --> 00:13:32.660
Most likely, the power within Joshua is hope,

00:13:32.660 --> 00:13:34.750
and Azmaria, charity.

00:13:34.750 --> 00:13:39.710
A devil can obtain an even greater
power by feeding upon the power of God.

00:13:39.710 --> 00:13:42.630
The same goes for devil worshippers.

00:13:42.630 --> 00:13:44.970
That's why they're being targeted.

00:13:44.970 --> 00:13:48.640
This power is not only beneficial. Causality...

00:13:48.640 --> 00:13:51.050
To put it simply, their luck goes bad.

00:13:52.310 --> 00:13:55.850
Just before the end of the war,
Azmaria lost both of her parents,

00:13:55.850 --> 00:13:58.480
and she was shuttled from
place to place between relatives.

00:13:58.480 --> 00:14:00.650
It looks like there wasn't
very much happiness in her life.

00:14:01.150 --> 00:14:05.070
I've had this power ever since I was little.

00:14:05.070 --> 00:14:08.450
But it's never been this strong.

00:14:08.450 --> 00:14:12.080
It looks like there's a connection
to the Prophecy of Fatima, but...

00:14:12.080 --> 00:14:13.120
Yes...

00:14:13.120 --> 00:14:15.160
Hey, Chrono!

00:14:15.160 --> 00:14:18.370
What is the meaning of you
making a guest do the cleaning?

00:14:18.370 --> 00:14:22.340
It's all right, I asked to be allowed to do it.

00:14:23.630 --> 00:14:26.670
Doing this helps me relax a little.

00:14:27.920 --> 00:14:31.890
The orchestra I was in was a very small one,

00:14:31.890 --> 00:14:36.310
so both children and adults
had to deal with all kinds of work.

00:14:36.310 --> 00:14:39.810
But everyone was happy and kind.

00:14:40.980 --> 00:14:42.480
It was so fun.

00:14:48.820 --> 00:14:52.370
Rosette, come here and help a little.

00:14:52.370 --> 00:14:53.950
Okay...

00:14:53.950 --> 00:14:56.240
Man, they treat their workers so roughly here.

00:14:56.240 --> 00:14:58.120
Well...

00:14:58.120 --> 00:15:01.540
If you would like, shall I help too?

00:15:01.540 --> 00:15:04.250
In that case,
can you get some tea ready for us?

00:15:05.300 --> 00:15:06.550
Okay!

00:15:06.550 --> 00:15:08.300
What about Ricardo?

00:15:08.300 --> 00:15:12.180
Unknown. He might be
preparing for a ceremony.

00:15:12.180 --> 00:15:16.560
He hasn't done anything in regards
to Azmaria for the past three days.

00:15:16.560 --> 00:15:20.850
He's confident that he
can take her back at any time.

00:15:20.850 --> 00:15:22.690
He certainly holds us in contempt.

00:15:24.060 --> 00:15:27.530
It is regrettable that we did not
discover the case of the orchestra sooner.

00:15:28.320 --> 00:15:30.320
The scene was in horrible condition.

00:15:31.240 --> 00:15:35.160
To think that the Apostles hold
that much significance for the devils...

00:15:36.330 --> 00:15:40.290
This will be difficult news for her.

00:15:40.290 --> 00:15:42.830
But we must tell her, mustn't we?

00:15:57.180 --> 00:16:01.560
It's my fault, again... I'm sorry!

00:16:03.100 --> 00:16:04.730
Azmaria!

00:16:04.730 --> 00:16:07.650
Thanks for bringing us tea!

00:16:09.440 --> 00:16:11.570
Did something happen?

00:16:11.570 --> 00:16:13.570
No, it's nothing...

00:16:13.570 --> 00:16:14.820
But...

00:16:14.820 --> 00:16:15.950
Thank you.

00:16:17.870 --> 00:16:21.290
It's all right now. I'm fine.

00:16:21.290 --> 00:16:22.580
Really?

00:16:28.880 --> 00:16:31.510
Come with me for a bit, will you?

00:16:31.510 --> 00:16:34.970
Rosette! What about these?

00:16:39.310 --> 00:16:41.180
She took Azmaria away?!

00:16:41.180 --> 00:16:43.730
Yes, we tried to stop her, but...

00:16:45.560 --> 00:16:48.150
Seriously, Rosette, that girl...

00:16:48.150 --> 00:16:52.280
She's likely at that
place again. I'll go get them later.

00:16:55.990 --> 00:16:58.330
Hurry up and come over here!

00:17:00.330 --> 00:17:01.910
Come on, let's go.

00:17:06.880 --> 00:17:10.750
This place is similar to
the place where I first met Rosette.

00:17:10.750 --> 00:17:13.590
It was around when she was your age.

00:17:13.590 --> 00:17:15.430
Rosette was an obstinate girl

00:17:15.430 --> 00:17:18.430
who wouldn't show her tears
in front of other people either.

00:17:18.430 --> 00:17:19.510
Here goes!

00:17:20.430 --> 00:17:24.940
She probably sees her old self in you.

00:17:24.940 --> 00:17:26.310
In me?

00:17:29.060 --> 00:17:33.360
What's with you two?
Don't make such fretful faces!

00:17:33.360 --> 00:17:35.610
That's overdoing it, Rosette.

00:17:35.610 --> 00:17:37.240
How horrible...

00:17:38.320 --> 00:17:40.030
What are you saying?
If it bothers you that much,

00:17:40.030 --> 00:17:42.490
then why don't you
stop complaining, and try fighting back?!

00:17:45.620 --> 00:17:46.750
Well!

00:17:46.750 --> 00:17:48.250
Take that! And that!

00:17:49.000 --> 00:17:52.380
You missed! Too slow, too sl

00:17:55.670 --> 00:17:57.010
Ouch...

00:17:57.010 --> 00:17:59.260
You're too slow too, Rosette!

00:17:59.260 --> 00:18:00.470
What did you say?

00:18:00.470 --> 00:18:01.930
Why you, why you!

00:18:01.930 --> 00:18:03.560
Take that! And that!

00:18:03.560 --> 00:18:06.020
Gotcha, gotcha! There!

00:18:08.650 --> 00:18:11.190
What's this with you
being the only one untouched?

00:18:11.190 --> 00:18:13.780
It's no fun to just watch!

00:18:13.780 --> 00:18:15.110
Well, then...

00:18:36.760 --> 00:18:37.800
Here you go.

00:18:37.800 --> 00:18:38.800
Thank you.

00:18:41.760 --> 00:18:43.470
It looks like you've cheered up.

00:18:45.770 --> 00:18:48.020
Right now, you've got a
really good look on your face.

00:18:49.100 --> 00:18:53.270
When you're having fun, have fun,
and when you get angry, be angry.

00:18:53.270 --> 00:18:55.690
And when you want to cry, cry your eyes out.

00:18:56.780 --> 00:18:59.150
After you've cried, you feel better, right?

00:19:00.410 --> 00:19:03.490
I'm sure that you'll be able to smile again.

00:19:04.330 --> 00:19:07.080
When you keep your problems
to yourself, and force yourself to smile,

00:19:07.080 --> 00:19:10.080
the person that it's hardest on is you.

00:19:10.830 --> 00:19:13.330
At least, that's what I get told a lot.

00:19:15.880 --> 00:19:18.300
Oh, that's nasty. You've caught a chill.

00:19:18.300 --> 00:19:19.250
You were playing around too much!

00:19:19.250 --> 00:19:19.590
Ow!

00:19:19.590 --> 00:19:22.050
There, your nose is runny.

00:19:31.440 --> 00:19:32.480
It's bitter!

00:19:38.320 --> 00:19:39.400
Chrono!

00:19:39.400 --> 00:19:42.410
I have come for you, young miss.

00:19:42.410 --> 00:19:43.410
Lerajie!

00:19:45.160 --> 00:19:51.290
All of the preparations
are in order. Did you have plenty of fun?

00:19:52.920 --> 00:19:55.000
Oh,no,my gun is...

00:19:55.000 --> 00:19:58.670
Long time no see, Sinner Chrono.

00:19:58.670 --> 00:20:00.840
Viscount Lerajie...

00:20:01.670 --> 00:20:03.840
Locked into a form like this...

00:20:03.840 --> 00:20:06.890
Have you fallen so far that
you cannot even shed your false form?

00:20:06.890 --> 00:20:08.600
That's enough.

00:20:08.600 --> 00:20:10.100
Die!

00:20:13.770 --> 00:20:14.940
Please wait!

00:20:15.810 --> 00:20:19.530
I'll go with you,
so please don't hurt these people.

00:20:19.530 --> 00:20:22.450
What are you saying?! You mustn't!

00:20:22.450 --> 00:20:23.740
Azmaria!

00:20:23.740 --> 00:20:29.740
It can't be helped.
It looks like I always bring unhappiness.

00:20:30.540 --> 00:20:34.000
Thank you for today.
I absolutely will not forget it.

00:20:35.920 --> 00:20:37.000
Azmaria!

00:20:41.710 --> 00:20:45.930
How wonderful. So young,
yet so noble in her resignation.

00:20:45.930 --> 00:20:47.220
But!

00:20:47.220 --> 00:20:50.640
From the beginning,
these people had no choice!

00:20:50.640 --> 00:20:52.140
That can't be! You promised!

